	(text "SIGNAL RELAYS: five 12 V automotive relays in sockets, off the board; their contacts tap the car's\nswitch wiring (Part 15.2). Each coil is switched low-side by a MOSFET whose gate has a 10 k pull-down\n(R54-R58): no drive from the pod, no relay. D15-D19 absorb each coil's turn-off spike."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 22.86 0)
		(effects
